      "source": "Return a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/security/Principal.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.security\"><code>Principal</code></a> instance containing the name\nof the authenticated user.",
