    {
      "source": "A SockJS session for use with the WebSocket transport.",
      "translation": "用于与 WebSocket 传输配合使用的 SockJS 会话。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the address on which the request was received.",
      "translation": "返回接收请求的地址。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Polling and Streaming sessions periodically close the current HTTP request and\nwait for the next request to come through.",
      "translation": "轮询和流式传输会话会定期关闭当前的 HTTP 请求，并等待下一个请求的到来。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Polling and Streaming sessions periodically close the current HTTP request and\nwait for the next request to come through. During this \"downtime\" the session is\nstill open but inactive and unable to send messages and therefore has to buffer\nthem temporarily. A WebSocket session by contrast is stateful and remain active\nuntil closed.",
      "translation": "轮询和流式传输会话会定期关闭当前的 HTTP 请求并等待下一个请求的到来。在此期间，“停机”时间内，会话仍然处于打开状态但不活动，无法发送消息，因此必须暂时缓冲这些消息。相比之下，WebSocket 会话是有状态的，并在关闭前保持活动状态。",
      "count": 1
    },
